invariant: INV-62
file: src/mldsa_sign_pack.c
catches: proof/prove-one.sh mldsa_sign_samplers_padded
reason: A pass of RejBoundedPoly's compaction reads the entry 2^bit above
  every position its first loop writes, and that loop must end at
  MLDS_ETA_READ_END (docs/decisions.md 200). Run over all 976 positions of
  the padded form, the pass of bit 9 reads up to 975 + 512, past the 992
  entries the array holds. A test can see the same values, since the
  stack above often holds zeros. The mldsa_sign_samplers_padded proof
  checks every read of the ten passes and fails on this edit.

--- old
    for (; p + step < MLDS_ETA_READ_END(step); p++) {
--- new
    for (; p < MLDS_ETA_SPAN; p++) {
